{#
| Variable              | Type      | Description                                                      |
|-----------------------|-----------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
| products.source       | string    |                                                                  |
| products.source_value | ?int[]    | ids of sources (product_ids, categories_ids, brands_id..etc)     |
| title                 | string    | Section title                                                    |
| display_all_url       | ?string   | If it's existed, mean should show load more link to this url     |
| position              | Int       | Sorting number start from zero                                   |
| limit                 | int       | Number of products to be shown                                   |
#}
<section data-testid="store-home-fixed-products" class="s-block container">
    {#
      The same header as the products carousel (T-4.03) — the title centred,
      «عرض الكل» under it — which is how both the mobile and the desktop Home
      artboards head a products section. Upstream's right-aligned title with
      the link at the far end appears in no artboard (2026-10-14).
    #}
    {% if title %}
        {% include 'components.ui.section-header' with {
            title: title,
            url: display_all_url,
            level: 2
        } %}
    {% endif %}
    {#
      Always the vertical grid — the card every artboard draws, gaining columns
      with the width (B4). Upstream read `vertical_fixed_products` here, but that
      setting is scoped to landing pages (owner, 2026-08-06) and ships off, so a
      Home section fell into Salla's two-column horizontal list with our vertical
      card stretched to half the screen — what the Salla reviewer saw on
      2026-10-20. landing-page.twig still reads the setting.
    #}
    <salla-products-list
      data-testid="store-home-fixed-products-list"
      source="{{ products.source }}"
      limit="{{ limit }}"
      source-value="{{ products.source_value|json_encode }}"
      class="vertical-products">
    </salla-products-list>
</section>


